    "details_slider_iWGfm4": {
      "type": "details-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "block_xtCJGC": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "img-ss-4": "shopify://shop_images/Self-loveStickers.webp",
            "heading": "Plan",
            "richtext": "<h3></h3><p>They say an idiot with a plan can beat a genius without a plan. But what if we can do both? Team up with Arctic Grey & get paired with your new team that specializes in all things Commerce, and create a <strong>plan of action</strong> for world domination.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "block_CcjddU": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "img-ss-4": "shopify://shop_images/HalloweenStickersC.webp",
            "heading": "Design",
            "richtext": "<h3></h3><p>Steve Jobs said design is not just what it looks like and feels like. <strong>Design is how it works.</strong> Partner with Arctic Grey to build an intuitive user experience designed to improve conversion rates & average order values.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_Rhn4p8": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "img-ss-4": "shopify://shop_images/featured-tab-collection-img.webp",
            "heading": "Develop",
            "richtext": "<h3></h3><p>Your online store is the heart of your business - <strong>don't let bad development slow you down</strong>. Let our Shopify experts take the reins on development so you can focus on your customer experience, not your back end. <a href=\"https://arcticgrey.com/#\" title=\"#\">🍑</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "block_gzGYh8": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "img-ss-4": "shopify://shop_images/featured-tab-collection-img.webp",
            "heading": "Deploy",
            "richtext": "<h3></h3><p>We have created a deployment process to <strong>launch everything from complex feature upgrades to brand new site builds</strong> via Github for perfect version control. No more, “oops! that update broke something on the live site!”</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_AzXkGj": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "img-ss-4": "shopify://shop_images/RicesantaFaceMask.webp",
            "heading": "A/B Testing",
            "richtext": "<h3></h3><p>Take the guess work out of everything! <strong>A/B Testing is the cheat code to success</strong>. Let us help you make decisions backed by data, showing you what changes actually work and what doesn't.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "block_xtCJGC",
